                    "richTextDescription": "Quantum information ideas and techniques are playing an increasing role in the study of quantum many body systems. We will review some recent results in this direction and discuss their relevance within the current program to give a mathematical classification of topological quantum phases of matter in 2D quantum spin systems. We will also describe some of the ideas and techniques behind the proofs.",
