                "d2132e7e-438d-46f2-9b0c-3698c408f2fe": {
                    "code": "SCVivianadelBarcoSESSION",
                    "description": "In this talk, I will discuss the parallel left-invariant $G_2^*$-structures on 7-dimensional Lie groups, focusing on those whose holonomy algebras are indecomposable and whose socle of the holonomy representation is maximal. Building on the classification of indecomposable holonomy algebras contained in $G_2^*$, it will be shown how to determine which ones arise as infinitesimal holonomy algebras for left-invariant $G_2^*$-structures. The main goal of the talk is to show that only abelian subalgebras occur, and these are necessarily of dimension two or three. I will provide explicit Lie groups with left-invariant $G_2^*$-structures realizing these abelian holonomies. This is a joint work with Ana Cristina Ferreira and Ines Kath.",
