                "6b593bdf-71dd-420e-bf51-3c8993749044": {
                    "code": "AndreasMattSession",
                    "description": "<div class=\"ag87-crtemvc-hsbk\">In my presentation, I present a variety of formats to introduce the mathematics of artificial intelligence (AI) to a large public audience. The formats presented range from interactive exhibits and video games to trainable neural networks and reinforcement learning simulators. My work demonstrates how exhibitions, museum and school installations, workshops (delivered both online and in person), and digital courses can effectively engage diverse audiences with the mathematics underlying artificial intelligence. All formats and tools are openly licensed and constitute part of the I AM A.I. exhibition ecosystem, developed by the nonprofit organization IMAGINARY.</div>",
                    "id": "6b593bdf-71dd-420e-bf51-3c8993749044",
                    "capacityId": "6b593bdf-71dd-420e-bf51-3c8993749044",
