                "9eea5450-ea95-47fa-bdc1-1368ae3b64ad": {
                    "code": "SCACarvalhoFreitasSESSION",
                    "description": "In this lecture, we are interested in studying Serrin’s overdetermined problems in Riemannian manifolds. For manifolds endowed with a conformal vector field, we prove a Pohozaev-type identity to establish a Serrin-type rigidity result using the P-function approach introduced by Weinberger. To achieve this, we proceed with a conformal change, starting from a geometric identity due to Schoen. Moreover, we obtain a symmetry result for the associated Dirichlet problem by utilizing a generalized normalized wall shear stress bound.",
