                "d6993a84-407b-4af7-af65-3fc0c4ca06c1": {
                    "code": "SCMohanBhupalSESSION",
                    "description": "We give a list of monodromy factorizations in the pure mapping class group $\\rm{PMod}(T^2_{d+1})$ of a torus with $d+1$ marked points that represent all lines (aka rational $(-1)$-curves)on a del Pezzo surface $Y={\\mathbb C}P^2\\#(9-d)\\overline{{\\mathbb C}P}^2$ of degree $d$, for $d\\leq 3$. These factorizations are lifts of a certain fixed monodromy factorization in $\\rm{PMod}(T^2_{d})$ that represents $Y$.In the case $d=1$, which we discuss in more detail, we give an explicit correspondence between the set of such factorizations and the240 roots of $E_8=K^\\perp$ (orthogonal complement in $H_2(Y)$ of the canonical class). This is a joint work with Sergey Finashin.",
