                    "code": "SCMercyOrukariSESSION",
                    "description": "This research investigates the flow of Casson magnetic fluid flow through a continuous shrinking surface using the Differential Transformation Method (DTM). By applying Lie similarity transformations, the governing partial differential equation is simplified into a nonlinear ordinary differential equation. This equation is then solved using DTM and validated through Pade ́ approximation. The findings are presented in a tabular and graphical format, offering insights into the flow behavior influenced by the physical parameters involved. The results demonstrate a high level of agreement with existing solutions in the literature.",
