                "e956e989-710c-4bc2-9eaa-6b3e2937c84f": {
                    "code": "SCPPrakashSESSION",
                    "description": "In this work, we consider one dimensional fuzzy fractional vibration equation with large membrane,\\\\\\begin{eqnarray*}\\frac{1}{\\tilde{c}^2} \\frac{\\partial^{\\beta}\\tilde{v}}{\\partial t^{\\beta}}=\\frac{\\partial^2 \\tilde{v}}{\\partial x^2} + \\frac{1}{x} \\frac{\\partial \\tilde{v}}{\\partial x}; 1<\\beta \\leq 2, t>0, x \\in [0, 1],\\end{eqnarray*}with\\begin{eqnarray*}\\tilde{v}(x,0)=\\tilde{p}(x), \\ \\ \\ \\tilde{v}'(x, 0)=\\tilde{c}\\tilde{q}(x),\\end{eqnarray*}where, $\\frac{\\partial^{\\beta}}{\\partial t^{\\beta}}$ is a Caputo fractional derivative. Scaling transformation is used to transform the fuzzy fractional vibration equation into the second order fuzzy fractional ordinary differential equation with variable coefficients. Invariant solutions are derived by solving the second order fuzzy fractional differential equations. Finite difference scheme is used to establish the numerical results. Examples are presented in detail.",
