                    "description": "We consider the periodic homogenization of the Maxwell-Stefan cross-diffusion system for three species with two equal binary diffusion coefficients. Via two-scale convergence, we derive the macroscopic limit and characterize the effective diffusion operator from cell problems. The limit equations describe diffusive transport of a gas mixture in a porous medium with periodic microstructure. To our knowledge, this constitutes the first rigorous homogenization result on the Maxwell-Stefan system. This work was carried out in collaboration with Claudia Nocita.",
