                    "description": "In $1973$, Harary and Palmer posed the problem of enumeration of labeled graphs on $n \\geq 1$ unisolated vertices and $l \\geq 0$ edges. In $1997$, Bender et al.\\ obtained a recurrence relation representing the sequence  $A054548$(OEIS) of labeled graphs on $n \\geq 0$ unisolated vertices containing $q \\geq \\frac{n}{2}$ edges. In $2020$, Bhavale and Waphare obtained a recurrence relation representing the sequence of fundamental basic blocks on $n \\geq 0$ comparable reducible elements, having nullity $l \\geq \\lfloor \\frac{n+1}{2} \\rfloor$. In this paper, we prove the equivalence of these two sequences. We also provide an edge labeling for a given vertex labeled finite simple graph.",
