                    "code": "SCEstherDavidsSESSION",
                    "description": "<div class=\"ag87-crtemvc-hsbk\">Many authors have considered several special functions and their applications in geometric function theory using different operators. Not much was known in literature on analytic functions associated with Sigmoid function using integral operator. Therefore, in this work, new classes of functions were introduced  using a new integral operator associated with Bessel and sigmoid functions were introduced. Their geometric properties were investigated. In particular, the authors introduced class Tn,ζ λ (ξ) and class Sn(Φ(σ) and obtained their geometric properties. Specifically, coefficient bounds, coefficients inequalities, growth and distortion theorems with other coefficient results for functions in these classes were obtained.</div>",
