                "d89549e0-fda0-431b-bb9f-8977a84a4a90": {
                    "code": "SCAnilKhairnarSESSION",
                    "description": "We introduced the class of weakly generalized p.q.-Baer $*$-rings. It is proved that under some assumptions every weakly generalized p.q.-Baer $*$-ring  can be embedded in generalized p.q.-Baer $*$-ring.  We proved that a generalized p.q.-Baer $*$-rings has partial comparability. If a generalized p.q.-Baer $*$-ring satisfies the parallelogram law then it is proved that every pair of projections has an orthogonal decomposition. A separation theorem for generalized p.q.-Baer $*$-rings is obtained. As an application of spectral theory, it is proved that generalized p.q.-Baer $*$-rings have  a sheaf representation with injective sections.",
