                "biography": "Şahsene Altınkaya was born in Bulgaria in 1990. She received her Ph.D. degree in Mathematics from Bursa Uludag University, Türkiye, in 2019. She began her academic career in 2013 as a Research Assistant in the Department of Mathematics at Bursa Uludag University, Türkiye. Between 2020 and 2024, she served as an Assistant Professor at Istanbul Beykent University, Türkiye. In 2024, she was awarded the title of Associate Professor in Mathematics in Türkiye. From January to October 2017, she was a visiting researcher at the Department of Natural Sciences at the University of Rzeszów in Poland. Between October 2024 and May 2025, she worked as a postdoctoral researcher in the Department of Mathematics and Statistics at the University of Turku, Finland. Her research interests include Geometric Function Theory, Special Functions, and Machine Learning.",
