utstanding scientific production (research excellence, and outstanding academic achievements). The Prof. E. Abreu has long and solid experience with scientific management and public resources in their different forms and also strong institutional commitment (including several types of Coordinations): 4 years as undergraduate Coordinator, 2 years as associate undergraduate (first term and now  re-elected for a second and more two-year term), ans since June of 2023 -present I am Graduate Coordinator of the Applied Mathematics Pr",
