eas like gender-based violence, economic growth determinants, and the impact of load shedding, showcasing a breadth of analytical application. He is also a co-author of several book chapters, demonstrating his contribution to broader academic discourse.Beyond individual research, Mukupa George has been actively involved in numerous joint research projects. These projects, often interdisciplinary and externally funded, demonstrate his collaborative spirit and commitment to addressing real-world challenges. Notable projects in",
